/// **Said only when `VERSION` is empty**, which is when it is true: the image
/// then resolves the LATEST game release, so the jar beside an existing world
/// changes the next time the container restarts after a new release. The
/// service's own comment promises the opposite, and an unset VERSION is the
/// one case where it does not hold.
